  "warnings": [
   "[auth] required ['EventTime', 'EventSource/Device', 'EventDetail/TypeId'] are left out when their input fields are empty, which makes the event invalid. Fine if those fields are always filled; otherwise give the mapping a default.",
   "[session end] required ['EventTime', 'EventSource/Device', 'EventDetail/TypeId'] are left out when their input fields are empty, which makes the event invalid. Fine if those fields are always filled; otherwise give the mapping a default.",
   "[tunnel] required ['EventTime', 'EventSource/Device', 'EventDetail/TypeId', 'EventDetail/Alert/Network/Source'] are left out when their input fields are empty, which makes the event invalid. Fine if those fields are always filled; otherwise give the mapping a default.",
   "[other] TypeId is read from kind, which its records may lack: those get TypeId 'other', as the schema requires one (without it the event fails validation). Give TypeId a default to choose another.",
   "[other] required ['EventTime', 'EventSource/Device'] are left out when their input fields are empty, which makes the event invalid. Fine if those fields are always filled; otherwise give the mapping a default."
  ],
